---@field promotionalOrderTypes? gcp.cloudchannel_v1.GoogleCloudChannelV1CustomerConstraintsPromotionalOrderTypesItemEnumList Allowed Promotional Order Type. Present for Promotional offers.

---@alias gcp.cloudchannel_v1.GoogleCloudChannelV1CustomerConstraintsAllowedCustomerTypesItemEnum "CUSTOMER_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"DOMAIN"|"TEAM"

