---Represents the price of the Offer.
---@class gcp.cloudchannel_v1.GoogleCloudChannelV1Price
---@field pricePeriod? gcp.cloudchannel_v1.GoogleCloudChannelV1Period The time period with respect to which base and effective prices are defined. Example: 1 month, 6 months, 1 year, etc.
